      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "כלי הנערים",
      "rationale": "״didirišwa tša bahlanela״ — barongwaedi ba fapana: ״didirišwa״, ״mebarwa״ goba ״mmele״ (Wycliffe: bodies); ״didirišwa״ e dula e le ya go swana le כלי."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "כתמול שלשם",
      "rationale": "Palo ya mabaka: maabane le pela — nako ya matšatši a tharo ya go hloka basadi."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "כי אם",
      "rationale": " כי אם ka mo go swanago le go bega nnete: ״nnete״ — e sego potšišo."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Dafida a araba ⟨את⟩ moperisita, a mo re: nnete, basadi ba ile ba emišwa go re maabane le pela, ge ke tšwa; gomme didirišwa tša bahlanela e be e le bokgethwa, le ge tselo e le ya tlwaelo; le go feta, le gajeno e tla kgethwa go didirišweng.",
